  <p id="c-nanqishu-005-wudifive-qi5:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">延興元年</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-005-wudifive-qi5:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">冬十月癸巳</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-005-wudifive-qi5:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">戊戌，誅新除中軍將軍<persName id="c-nanqishu-005-wudifive-qi5:p003:m0010" ref="63c_vmw_dyi">桂陽王鑠</persName>、撫軍將軍<persName id="c-nanqishu-005-wudifive-qi5:p003:m0019" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_G">衡陽王鈞</persName>、侍中祕書監<persName id="c-nanqishu-005-wudifive-qi5:p003:m0029" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_B">江夏王鋒</persName>、鎮軍將軍建安王<persName id="c-nanqishu-005-wudifive-qi5:p003:m0041" ref="kix_r92_2ed_I">子真</persName>、左將軍巴陵王<persName id="c-nanqishu-005-wudifive-qi5:p003:m0050" ref="kix_r92_2ed_K">子倫</persName>。</p>
